# Pulumi TypeScript ComponentResource: App Stack

Below is a complete, production-ready implementation of a Pulumi ComponentResource wrapping S3, RDS PostgreSQL, and IAM role with dev/prod environment support.

## Project Structure

```
.
├── index.ts
├── components/
│   └── appStack.ts
├── Pulumi.yaml
├── Pulumi.dev.yaml
├── Pulumi.prod.yaml
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
```

## File: `package.json`

```json
{
  "name": "app-infra",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Pulumi IaC for app infrastructure",
  "main": "index.ts",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",
    "preview": "pulumi preview",
    "up": "pulumi up",
